- **[NEW]** `share_id` at `/en/exchange` is gated by **DB record existence, not format**: `share_id=11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555` (well-formed, non-existent) → **HTTP 404 / 511B**; the two known share_ids resolve. Both known tokens are published in plaintext in the 301 `Location` of public stems.
