## Important Details
- Scope: only company-owned Hypofriend infrastructure/domains (see inventory). Report channel is bugs.olivermaicher.eu.
- Rules: passive-first, ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only for live probes; no auth-bypass or mutating tests against live customer data; no scanner output without manual validation; do not expose customer/employee/financial/auth data during testing.
- REJECTED classes (do not file): DoS/rate-limit, account-lockout, descriptive errors/headers only, robots.txt/public files, outdated libs, OPTIONS/TRACE, logout/anonymous-form CSRF, non-sensitive cookie flags, self-XSS, clickjacking w/o exploit, SSL/TLS, mail config, password-recovery policy, username enumeration, etc.
