- `core.hypofriend.de` = live Rails origin (direct, no CloudFront) vs edge full CF stack — persistent security-header differential (origin `XFO: ALLOWALL` / bare headers vs edge `XFO: DENY` + nosniff/xss-protection/referrer-policy).

