evidence_needed: a server-side record showing the forged utm triple persisted against the vendor's affiliate/partner attribution, or a commission ledger line generated from it. Both require vendor-side visibility.
verify_steps: 1) `GET https://hypofriend.de/en/exchange?share_id=dddb5cba-7e96-44b2-be7d-bb621c8a8e68&link_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&redirect=account&utm_source=aff&utm_medium=cpa&utm_campaign=probe` and confirm the triple is echoed into `Location`; 2) capture the resolved first-party URL for later vendor-side correlation; 3) no further step is available without vendor access.
impact: a credible first-party URL carrying attacker-chosen attribution, mintable at scale from a published key pool, feeding a partner/affiliate payout programme — direct financial loss plus reputational damage to the attribution data itself. Medium-high.
