[LEARN]
- **Route mapping is method-dependent for GraphQL.** A recorded `404` obtained via GET does not establish that the path is unrouted. Re-test GraphQL candidates with POST before recording them absent.
- **Trailing-slash GraphQL paths are the same route.** `/q/` and `/q` produced byte-identical responses; compare normalized bodies (mask `serverTime`) to prove or disprove equivalence in one paired control.
- **`missingMutationConfiguration` is a config-level proof of no write surface**, and is strictly better evidence than an authorization failure or a 301 gate.
- **Shipped client code can target an undeployed schema surface.** Queries mined from a public bundle must be validated against the live schema before being treated as attack surface — `ChatLinkPreviewPost` has existed in the bundle while its field has not existed on the endpoint.
- **`serverUrl`/`baseUrl` are unreliable transport leads in a minified bundle.** Both were Amplitude telemetry here; the real base was a `window.location.origin`-derived expression reached through `postGraphQL`.

[RISK]
- **R1** `/content/q/` reflects arbitrary Origins with `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true`. No impact proven — mutations are disabled and no readable query field was identified. Risk is **low**, and would rise immediately if the content schema is restored with the slug-addressed `post` query, since a query is not subject to the 301 write-gate.
- **R2** 45-name negative on the content Query surface is incomplete; the real root field may be a name I did not guess. Continued guessing has low expected yield.
- **R3** `api.hypofriend.de` remains unreachable (no live surface), so its relationship to `/content/q/` is untested.

[NEXT] Run **one** poisoned document against `POST https://hypofriend.de/content/q/` probing whether graphql-ruby's did-you-mean suggester is enabled on this schema, using near-misses of known-good field names (`titel`, `previw`, `slugg`, `seo_descripton`) alongside one poison field — if suggestions appear in `extensions`, the content Query surface becomes enumerable at zero record cost and the 45-name negative can be replaced with a real enumeration.
