- `extensions.fieldName` + `extensions.typeName` make a clean, resolver-free existence oracle: `(zzzA:1)` on a real field yields `Unknown argument`, on an absent field yields `undefinedField` — one document can test ~50 names with **zero resolver invocation and zero records read**.
