## Important Details
- Report channel: `bugs.olivermaicher.eu`.
- Authoritative scope: `scope.yml` and `inventory/hypofriend.md`; eligible assets are Hypofriend-operated infrastructure, APIs, financial/mortgage platforms, portals, applications, websites, and affiliated brands.
- Current state: phase `POC`, target `api`; `api.hypofriend.de` resolves to `52.15.184.3` but returns `000` on `:80`/`:443` for 53 consecutive cycles.
- Current probe policy: live testing must remain read-only `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`, at `≤1 rps`; do not send POST, mutations, auth-bypass tests, or customer/employee data.
- Do not report descriptive stack traces, headers, scanner output, TLS issues, clickjacking without an exploit, public login pages, logout CSRF, non-sensitive cookie flags, or known-library findings as standalone vulnerabilities.
- Claims must distinguish facts from hypotheses; use paired controls and correct prior claims explicitly.
- Highest priorities: `core.hypofriend.de/property-search-api` score `9.4` / priority `9.25`; `hypofriend.de/en/exchange` score `8.7` / priority `8.55`; `core.hypofriend.de/q` family score `8.4` / priority `8.30`.
- `api.hypofriend.de` is priority `2.1` / `2.70` and dead; phase mismatch prevents POC completion through the designated target.
- Latest recorded surface cycle: `2026-10-04 02:48 UTC`; no verified new delta after the `2026-10-03 23:09 UTC` findings.

