- Keep findings evidence-backed, ranked by business impact, and compliant with passive-first/no-customer-data testing constraints.

## Important Details
- Report channel: `bugs.olivermaicher.eu`; in-scope assets are company-owned Hypofriend infrastructure/apps/APIs under `scope.yml` and `inventory/hypofriend.md`.
- Current state: `phase=POC`, `target=api`; `api.hypofriend.de` resolves to `52.15.184.3` but remains HTTP `000` after repeated TCP/TLS timeouts, creating a phase mismatch.
- Live probing must remain passive-first, `≤1 rps`, and GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only; no auth bypass, mutation testing, bulk PII retrieval, or customer-record testing.
- Reject descriptive headers/errors, logout CSRF, clickjacking without exploit, TLS best-practice issues, availability-only outages, scanner-only reports, and other explicitly rejected classes.
- Highest-value confirmed issue: unauthenticated `propertySearch→exposes→expose` PII BOLA on `core.hypofriend.de/property-search-api`, directly bypassing CloudFront controls; quantification is `HUMAN_ONLY`.
- `/q` family has global credentialed CORS, `root.form_authenticity_token`, `root.lead.has_admin_cookie`, and error-channel schema reconstruction; state-changing cross-origin impact remains unproven and `AUTH_HELPED`.
- `/content/q/` is a live fourth GraphQL instance on both hosts; credentialed CORS is active, mutations return `missingMutationConfiguration`, and its suggester channel is absent.
- Hardcoded Basic credential `hypo:advisors2018+` (`Basic aHlwbzphZHZpc29yczIwMTgr`, known b64-token sha256 prefix `56f00b87f9a28c8...`) ships publicly in `CMAtwEsq.js`; `/api/v3/advisors` returned `200` when supplied by the client. Do not use it in active tests.
- Reconfirmed false-positive controls: `unclaimLead` is zero-argument/session-scoped; `document_analysis_status` and `exposeSeen` are not existence oracles; `updateProperty` uses server-closed `PropertyMutationsUpdateInput`; `property-search-api` does not echo ACAO; `Vary:Origin` is correctly present on `/q` POST and absent only on OPTIONS.
- `/en/exchange` forge is bounded: six publicly harvestable `share_id` keys, arbitrary `link_id`, raw `utm_*` pass-through, but redirect allowlist is only `{expose,account}` and destination shells are not data leaks or frameable pages.

## Work State
### Completed
- Validated full-DB unauthenticated PII BOLA on `core.hypofriend.de/property-search-api`, including owner/broker names, companies, email, and phone fields.
- Confirmed direct-origin header/WAF differential: bare origin responses versus edge CloudFront security stack; CORS remains closed on `property-search-api`.
