- Fingerprinted `mobile.hypofriend.de` ELB IPs `63.176.45.32`, `63.182.230.5`, `63.189.130.21`; zero-target `503` is availability-only.
- Rejected `*.app.hypofriend.de` as an active dangling-CNAME takeover; only future EIP recycling remains plausible.
- Closed `/en/account` SSRF review, client mass-assignment claim, `createUploadUrl`, and several alleged IDORs with positive controls.
- No repository files or application code were modified.

### Active
- Priority 1: `core.hypofriend.de/property-search-api`, priority `9.1`, confidence `92`; PII BOLA confirmed, bulk quantification human-gated.
- Priority 2: `/q` GraphQL family, priority `8.0`, confidence `55`; credentialed cross-origin read prerequisites confirmed, mutation leg unproven.
- Priority 3: `*.app.hypofriend.de`, priority `7.3`, confidence `45`; stale-A EIP-recycling window requiring cloud-side verification.
- Parked `/en/exchange` forge at priority `6.7`; credible first-party URL and attribution poisoning only.
- Parked `/content/q` schema reconstruction; mutations disabled and error suggester unavailable.
